One small point on the dance of death with a troll.  If I kill it with Stormy
does the troll come to life as it was originally generated or does it ressurect
as a puny troll?

Can I ask if  anybody other than me is  excessively annoyed by  the limitations
put on memorising spells.   Magic users are meant to use magic - why  limit the
number of  times they can  cast spells like magic missle (which is 1st level in
AD'n'D)?   I can understand on  spells like genocide,  but can't some spells be
limited  only by mana,  and not by  memory?    You could  even  have  the  mana
recuperate slightly more slowly or indeed in  line with the mages intelligence,
to prevent extreme misuse by characters who should not be casting spells at all
such as Barbarians.  I am getting more and more frustrated by this... please do
something about it.

Thanks

